OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAMet Police trial facial
OL,4,Arecognition tech on phones
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice officers can now use their
OL,7,Fphones to photograph and identify
OL,8,Fsuspects without their consent, as part
OL,9,Fof a new facial recognition pilot
OL,10,Ftaking place in the capital.
OL,12,FFor six months, 100 Metropolitan Police
OL,13,Fofficers have been given clearance to
OL,14,Fcheck people's faces using an app
OL,15,Fcomparing their photo to a database of
OL,16,Fcustody images.
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,326,320,200,140,0,100
