OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAMet Police trial facial
OL,4,Arecognition tech on phones
OL,5,
OL,6,FOfficers must tell people before taking
OL,7,Ftheir photo but do not need their
OL,8,Fpermission, Scotland Yard said, and
OL,9,Fthey can use the app while out and
OL,10,Fabout investigating any "recordable
OL,11,Foffence".
OL,13,F"If this means we get a far speedier
OL,14,Fresponse than we would ordinarily, I
OL,15,Fthink that's a good thing for the
OL,16,Fpublic of London," said Cdr Nick John.
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
